    "title": "Is the stock market closed on Good Friday?",
    "text": "BUSINESSIs the stock market closed on Good Friday?Maria Francis Rin VelascoUSA TODAY NETWORK - New EnglandApril 3, 2026, 8:06 a.m. ETGood Friday is not a federal holiday in Rhode Island or the rest of the United States, but it is a public holiday for some states and there will be lots of closed businesses and services, including the stock market.The Nasdaq and the New York Stock Exchange will be closed on Good Friday, but most banks will be open for regular business hours. Many schools are off for Good Friday and the Easter weekend break.",
